Shouldn't this change leverage the recent improvement to SystemExitException to report any available exit code to the shell?  It would look something like:

```
catch (const Base::SystemExitException& e) {
         exit(e.getExitCode());
```

Instead of always reporting 0 (non-error) to the shell upon a SystemExitException unless of course if the exitCode is actually a 0 ;)

